            "value": "Arctic Ocean Chlorophyll a from SeaWiFS and MODIS/Aqua satellite data (R2018) using regional AOReg.emp algorithm.  Each netCDF files contains 46 images comprising 8-day composites for a specific year.  See the README file for more information.",
